		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Ya Salaams,<br />
 What a sweet and deep presence!  His hugs and kisses on the cheek were a steady presence at NW Sufi camp for so many years. How blessed to have traveled with him in Men&#8217;s circles and large Dance circles for years.</p>
<p>  Many blessings,<br />
                 Hafiz</p>
