	<item>
		<title>By: Yusuf Leo Schuman</title>
		<link>http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=720&#038;cpage=1#comment-9949</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Yusuf Leo Schuman]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 09 Oct 2011 23:15:15 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=720#comment-9949</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Jamshed was and is a dear spiritual friend of mine. He brought me to this path, a gift for which I will always be grateful. He taught me in the truest way: by example, not words. Through vulnerability, not pretense. In subtle changes visible over time, not rushed or hurried acts.
   Much love to you, always, Jamshed. You were fun to play with.
   Yusuf

A slideshow of images of our friend is available here:
http://www.twocrow.com/docs/Jamshed_Slideshow.pdf]]></description>
