	<item>
		<title>By: Danette Burchill</title>
		<link>http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=720&#038;cpage=1#comment-6392</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Danette Burchill]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 12 Oct 2010 04:29:48 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=720#comment-6392</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[I was blessed to know Jamshed and call him my Uncle since 2002, when I met him while living in the community at Breitenbush Hot Springs.  He brought light into my life and continues to do so.  I wish him all the best in his travels onward.

With love and gratitude,
  Danette]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I was blessed to know Jamshed and call him my Uncle since 2002, when I met him while living in the community at Breitenbush Hot Springs.  He brought light into my life and continues to do so.  I wish him all the best in his travels onward.</p>
<p>With love and gratitude,<br />
  Danette</p>
]]></content:encoded>
